emove  ConfigConstants ([#4079](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4079))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step4 - move more constants from RemotingConstants into dubbo-remoting-api ([#4077](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4077))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step4 - remove RpcConstants ([#4072](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4072))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step4 - remove MonitorConstants ([#4069](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4069))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step4 - remove ClusterConstants ([#4065](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4065))\n* remove compatible key when merging #4059 ([#4064](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4064))\n* [DUBBO-3778]: Annotation mode cannot set service parameters in 2.7.0 ([#4060](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4060))\n* [DUBBO-3650]: Dubbo 2.7.0的provider无法指定客户端默认async ([#4058](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4058))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step4 - start to review RemotingConstants ([#4057](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4057))\n* change concurrent list  to regular list ([#4056](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4056))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step3, remove constants completely. ([#4053](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4053))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: move MetadataReportConstants back into metata-report-api module ([#4049](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4049))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step3 - start to use ClusterConstants and MonitorConstants  ([#4045](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4045))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step3 - start to use RpcConstants ([#4038](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4038))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step3 - start to use RegistryConstants ([#4035](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4035))\n* optimize array code style ([#4031](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4031))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step3 - start using CommonConstants ([#4030](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4030))\n* use equal explicit class to replace anonymous class ([#4027](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4027))\n* fix telnet not work in some scene (#4007) ([#4026](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4026))\n* support nacos metadata ([#4025](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4025))\n* Fix Invocation attributes ([#4024](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4024))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step3 - seperate constants for remoting ([#4023](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4023))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step2 - seperate constants for config, remoting, rpc ([#4021](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4021))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: step2 - seperate constants for cluster, common, filter, monitor, and registry ([#4020](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4020))\n* optimize some code style ([#4006](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/4006))\n* [Dubbo-3764]Merge dubbo rpc xmlrpc (#3764) ([#3775](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3775))\n* [Dubbo-3669]do local export before register any listener. ([#3685](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3685))\n\n\n## Code Review Statistics\n\nDubbo encourages everyone to participant in code review, in order to improve software quality. Every week @dubbo-bot would automatically help to count pull request reviews of single github user as the following. So, try to help review code in this project.\n\n| Contributor ID | Pull Request Reviews |\n|:--------------:|:--------------------:|\n| @ralf0131 | 13 |\n| @chickenlj | 12 |\n| @CrazyHZM | 11 |\n| @beiwei30 | 8 |\n| @cvictory | 5 |\n| @danielamorais | 3 |\n| @Moriadry | 2 |\n| @Leishunyu | 1 |\n| @Jeff-Lv | 1 |\n| @mercyblitz | 1 |\n| @carryxyh | 1 |\n| @fibbery | 1 |\n\n\n## Contributors Overview\n\nIt is Dubbo team's great honor to have new contributors from community. We really appreciate your contributions. Feel free to tell us if you have any opinion and please share this open source project with more people if you could. If you hope to be a contributor as well, please start from https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md .\nHere is the list of new contributors:\n\n@wavesZh\n\n\nThanks to you all.\n\n\n\n*Note: This robot is supported by [Collabobot](https://github.com/AlibabaDR/Collabobot).*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/4083/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/4083/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]